# PC card pc-melee-far (docs/bench/melee-top3.md, MGUN-25, BENCH-188): one build alone on today's whole melee field, 46 fields x 6 fresh seeds (3288-3293, after pc-melee-strong's 3280-3287), at the machine's melee width (@C@, fixed at prep) and CPU constant; the bench drops the robots broken-1.11.2.txt lists (BENCH-169). Template: mfprep writes work/melee-far-<arm>.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm's suffix (aa, bb, y3, y5); every arm fights the same fields and seeds, so the read pairs them battle for battle.
